+Feature: Local Flag Evaluator
+
+  @server
+  Scenario: A filter type added after the SDK shipped is inconclusive
+    Given the SDK is initialized with token "test-token" and local evaluation enabled
+    And local feature flag "beta" has a condition filter of type "future_type" on key "plan" with operator "exact" and condition value "pro"
+    When local feature flag "beta" is evaluated with person property "plan" equal to "pro"
+    Then local evaluation should be inconclusive for "beta"
+    And the unresolved reason should be "unsupported_definition"
+
+  @server
+  Scenario: A filter without a type field matches as a person filter
+    Given the SDK is initialized with token "test-token" and local evaluation enabled
+    And local feature flag "beta" has a condition filter with no type on key "plan" with operator "exact" and condition value "pro"
+    When local feature flag "beta" is evaluated with person property "plan" equal to "pro"
+    Then the local evaluation result should be true
+
+  @server
+  Scenario: A person_metadata filter with a same-named caller property
+    Given the SDK is initialized with token "test-token" and local evaluation enabled
+    And local feature flag "first-seen" has a condition filter of type "person_metadata" on key "created_at" with operator "is_date_after" and condition value "2025-01-01"
+    When local feature flag "first-seen" is evaluated with person property "created_at" equal to "2026-06-01"
+    Then the local evaluation result should be true
